                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The very BEST SHIVER EPISODE, and one of the best written and executed Point&Click Puzzle game. \nThe depressing, scary atmosphere is amazing, the story unfolds into something unexpected, the story writing is undestandable but also not over-explanatory, and the bonus chapter is also an adequate, relevant epilogue complementary to the main story. \n\nMost of the utility items and puzzles are not out-of-style, illogical, irrelevant slop like in most of similar games. You don't need to go back and forth the whole game for objectives, it's designed in a way that you play in one group of areas at a time, without the feeling of being constrained.\n\nIt would honestly deserve a Very Positive Steam score at least, imo.",
